Third-Party Software
---
The distributions include the third-party software below, each under its own license. The full license and notice texts ship in each distribution's doc/licenses folder, one subfolder per component. Which components a distribution carries depends on the platform: on Linux, SDL2, OpenCV, Mbed TLS, LAME and unixODBC are system libraries installed by the package manager, not shipped.

Mbed TLS (Windows, macOS)
• Copyright The Mbed TLS Contributors. Apache License 2.0.

nghttp2
• Copyright Tatsuhiro Tsujikawa and contributors. MIT License.

ngtcp2 and nghttp3 (Linux, macOS)
• Copyright ngtcp2 and nghttp3 contributors. MIT License.

AWS-LC (Linux, macOS)
• Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates, and the BoringSSL and OpenSSL authors. Apache License 2.0, with portions under the ISC, MIT, BSD 3-Clause and MIT-0 licenses as listed in its LICENSE file.

ONNX Runtime
• Copyright Microsoft Corporation. MIT License, with the third-party notices in its ThirdPartyNotices.txt.
• DirectML (Windows x64, when the operating system does not provide it): Microsoft DirectML License.
• Qualcomm AI Engine Direct (QNN) runtime libraries (Windows ARM64): Copyright Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. Distributed under the Qualcomm license in doc/licenses/qnn.

OpenCV (Windows, macOS)
• Copyright the OpenCV authors. Apache License 2.0.
• OpenCV's bundled third-party components (including zlib, libjpeg-turbo, libpng, libtiff, libwebp and, on Windows x64, FFmpeg under the LGPL 2.1) are under the licenses in doc/licenses/opencv.

SDL2, SDL2_image, SDL2_mixer, SDL2_ttf, SDL2_net, SDL2_rtf and SDL2_sound (Windows, macOS)
• Copyright Sam Lantinga and Ryan C. Gordon. zlib License.
• Their bundled components (including FreeType, HarfBuzz, zlib, libtiff, libwebp, Ogg/Vorbis, Opus and libmodplug) are under the licenses in doc/licenses/sdl2.

SDL2_gfx
• Copyright Andreas Schiffler. zlib License.

LAME (Windows, macOS)
• Copyright The LAME Project. GNU Library General Public License, version 2. LAME ships as a separate shared library that can be replaced.

iODBC (macOS)
• Copyright OpenLink Software. BSD License or GNU Library General Public License, at the user's choice.

LIBSVM
• The support vector machine in the System.ML library is a port of LIBSVM. Copyright Chih-Chung Chang and Chih-Jen Lin. BSD 3-Clause License.

VADER
• The sentiment lexicon in the NLP library reuses values from VADER (Valence Aware Dictionary and sEntiment Reasoner). Copyright (c) 2016 C.J. Hutto. MIT License.

Eigen
• Copyright the Eigen authors, including Benoît Jacob and Gaël Guennebaud. Mozilla Public License 2.0; source at https://eigen.tuxfamily.org.

Lato font
• Copyright Łukasz Dziedzic. SIL Open Font License 1.1.
